muted">Every piece carries a BIS hallmark. What we say is 22 karat, is 22 karat — verifiable, always.</p></div></li><li class="group flex gap-6 border-t border-line py-7 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 md:gap-10"><div><h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-text-strong md:text-[1.7rem]">Transparent pricing</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md font-body text-[0.92rem] font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Gold at the day&#x27;s rate, making charges shown openly. No riddles, no surprises at the counter.</p></div></li><li class="group flex gap-6 border-t border-line py-7 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 md:gap-10"><div><h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-text-strong md:text-[1.7rem]">Handcrafted by artisans</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md font-body text-[0.92rem] font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Karigars who have shaped gold for decades, working each setting by hand the way it has always been done.</p></div></li><li class="group flex gap-6 border-t border-line py-7 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 md:gap-10"><div><h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-light text-text-strong md:text-[1.7rem]">Lifetime of trust</h3><p class="mt-2 max-w-md font-body text-[0.92rem] font-light leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Fair exchange and buy-back, cleaning and care — a relationship that outlasts the purchase.</p></div></li></ul><div class="mt-10"><div class="glass-button-wrap"><a class="glass-button group backdrop-blur-[14px] backdrop-saturate-[1.35] glass-ghost" href="/chheda-promise"><span class="glass-button-text font-body font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] px-6 py-3.5 text-[0.72rem]">Read our full story<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 inline-block translate-x-0 transition-transform duration-[var(--dur-fast)] ease-[var(--ease-lux)] group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></span></a><div aria-hidden="true" class="glass-button-shadow"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="jewellery-types" class="relative w-full bg-transparent py-20 md:py-44" data